    "reducer": "runtimeErrors/consoleErrors/consoleWarnings/cspErrors/assetErrors/forbiddenRequests/captureErrors = corresponding ERROR rows; failedRequests = NET_FAIL count; reject any nonzero then compare exact driver.counters to recomputation; META fields/counts are checked, never authority",
    "requestSafety": "sameOrigintrue; methodGET; queryPresent/fragmentPresent/userInfoPresent/authorizationPresent/cookiePresent/bodyPresent allfalse; safe allowlist path only else null and reject; no raw URL/ID/text",
    "seq": "contiguous1..N global safe journal arrival order",
    "status": "FROZEN_SAFE_OBSERVATION_JOURNAL_NOT_PACKET_ATTESTATION",
